{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Revertices</i> is a 2D sidescrolling action\u00a0game where you must choose a lone survivor! However, the chosen must fight the corrupted remains of their two beloved friends. Uncover different facets of the story, gameplay, and character relationships in each route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of three survivors:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ders Quera - The Mentor\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236560/extras/e7bc57771076a289c42ef9035c6ec84e.poster.avif?t=1759348811\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236560/extras/e7bc57771076a289c42ef9035c6ec84e.apng?t=1759348811\" class=\"bb_img\" width=194 height=174 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ders holds a high leadership position within the village. They're a hard-working mentor to Cirne and Trale. Ders is a heavy-hitting swordfighter! Their special move is a powerful ground pound that can be used to fall quickly and safely or as a devastating attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cirne Glecre - The Delinquent</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236560/extras/4fa2c9cd5b821708fd3d40d947d905e1.poster.avif?t=1759348811\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236560/extras/4fa2c9cd5b821708fd3d40d947d905e1.apng?t=1759348811\" class=\"bb_img\" width=194 height=174 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cirne is one of many fighters that trains under Ders. Despite their disobedience and spontaneous ways, Cirne manages to weasel into the hearts of their fellow colleagues. Cirne is a fast-paced fighter with two daggers! Their special move is a fast dash to quickly escape and damage enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trale Lugiben - The Diligent</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236560/extras/78034ad4ce11541b8d3ad8fe38c5ab38.poster.avif?t=1759348811\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236560/extras/78034ad4ce11541b8d3ad8fe38c5ab38.apng?t=1759348811\" class=\"bb_img\" width=194 height=174 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trale is another fighter in training and Ders's pupil. They're generally reserved and a little timid but they are respected among their peers for their exceptional skills. Trale is a ranged character that fights with a bow! They can shoot arrows rapidly or fire a charge shot. Their special move is a defensive bubble that pushes away enemies and deflects projectiles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique boss battles with their own variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple routes and endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overarching story about survival and community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal imagery inspired by RPG Maker horror games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by Lex Feathers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revertices is currently mid-development.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3236560?t=1759348811","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3236560?t=1759348811","capsule_image":"https://sha